+# Staging Canary & Retrain Test Runbook
+
+Purpose
+- Nightly / on-demand test that exercises retrain -> deploy canary -> perf test -> promote/rollback flow in staging.
+
+Prereqs
+- Staging cluster with vLLM deployed (helm/aegis-vllm)
+- Argo workflows and retrain job configured
+- Prometheus and smoke endpoints available
+- CI runner or operator with kubectl access
+
+Steps
+1. Trigger retrain (Argo) or generate a new model image.
+2. Deploy to canary Deployment (aegis-inference-canary).
+3. Run ops/ci/run_perf_test.sh against canary service; collect p95/p99 metrics.
+4. Run ops/cicd/canary_promote.py (it will promote or abort based on Prometheus metric checks).
+5. If promote fails, collect logs and run rollback (kubectl rollout undo deployment/...).
+6. Record evidence for each step (manifests created by evidence_sdk).
+
+Postmortem
+- If any step fails, collect artifacts: Prometheus query results, pod logs, retrain logs, model artifacts, and add to audit bundle.
+
